#40102
A Spacious Cloak Room~
   The hallway continues, dominated at this point by another set of doors,
equal in size and majesty to those that barred entrance to this place.  A great
deal of noise issues from behind this portal, which may or may not be an
incentive to proceed in this direction.  The air is warm, and carries a strong
odor of sweat mingled with a slight stench of decay, emanating from several
uncured hides piled here.  To the west, a flight of steps leads up into a guard
tower.    
~
