#40107
A Dark Junction~
   Inadequate lighting (perhaps due to fear that excessive torchlight poses a
fire hazard) makes it difficult to see far in any direction from this junction,
though a bend in the corridor is apparent to the west, and two doors can be
seen to the south.  Footsteps can be heard, as if from nearby, though the heavy
tread of a giant is audible some distance away.  Occasionally you can hear a
raucous cry, coming from somewhere to the north.    
