#40109
Barracks Hall~
   A total of ten large beds, piled high with hides, fill most of this narrow
hall, ample evidence of a barracks for some of the many giants that inhabit
this wooden keep.  Dirty capes, smeared with grime from days of travel, hang
from hooks set in the walls, and large pairs of muddy boots mar the floor.  
Several iron cressets line the walls, some containing the smoldering stubs of
torches.    
~
