A Bend in the Corridor~
   The corridor bends here, offering two possible destinations to those brave
enough to have penetrated this evil lair.  Shouts and cries issue at random
intervals from the north, ample evidence of alert inhabitants.  It would be a
change to catch the giants who live here awake, it seems most of them spend a
