#40114
The End of the Corridor~
   At the northern end of this corridor, you are faced with two choices, both
of them wooden portals, set in the western and northern walls.  By now you
estimate that you have penetrated at least halfway into the steading, and must
surely be nearing the mastermind of the dark race that abides here.  
Hopefully, at any rate, the sooner you are able to evacuate this foul structure
the better, giants are poor company at the best of times.    
