#40115
Maids' Chamber~
   This spacious chamber houses the many maids that serve the more important
giants of the Steading, most notably the ruler and his wife.  Several beds line
the walls, while two wardrobes hold the clothing owned by those quartered here.
The air is warmed by a blazing fire in the hearth, and the air is thick with
greasy smoke.  It would be fair to say that even the cleanest of hill giants
appear to prefer to live in squalor.    
~
