#40116
A Spacious Hall~
   You pass into a spacious hall, that stretches in each direction save the
south, where it terminates in a wooden door.  To the west lies a brightly lit
wing, which bends southward, and apparently houses the belongings of a giant of
importance, even from here numerous trophies and tapestries are visible.  To
the west lies a large pair of double doors, equal in dimension to those at the
entrance to the Steading.  From behind them issue various sounds, including
shouts, cries, moans and belches.    
