the hallway casts illumination across only the first third of what is a large
bedchamber.  Filled with stolen wooden furniture that came from a dozen raids,
it also boasts many stuffed footstools, rugs and a table lined with chairs.  
The door to this room opens inwards, making it impossible to see what may be
lurking behind it.    
