#40130
Approaching the Great Hall~
   The corridor nears the central hall of the steading, where the bulk of the
giants spend much of their free time carousing.  It is here that you will find
the chieftain of these foul beasts, and perhaps also the source behind their
sudden uprising against the lands of man.  The air is smoky, and carries the
stench of burning flesh, as several dwarven carcasses are roasted within the
hall to the north.    
