The Great Hall~
   This spacious hall is filled with rows of trestle tables, laden with food
and wine, at which are seated many shouting, fighting, laughing and vomiting
giants, in various states of intoxication.  Tankards are hurled about by rowdy
revellers, while large chunks of meat are torn from the slowly roasting dwarven
