A Guest Chamber~
   Several beds fill this chamber, arranged about a fire place, which is
currently cold and empty.  Smoldering brands cast a dim illumination over the
heaps of furs and hides, which partially obscure chests that are filled with
the clothing of the visiting giants quartered here.  A single table, matched by
four chairs, bears numerous gaming devices, and beneath it lies yet another
chest.  Doubtless some item of small interest may well be turned up by a
thorough search, but it would be a timely venture.    
~
