opens onto another communal area.  The air is thick with smoke, but also
carries the faint odor of burning flesh.  Giants are well known for their
propensity to devour their foes, irrespective of the race of said foes, and it
wouldn't surprise you to find a halfling or even a dwarf on the spit somewhere.
  
~
