#40192
A Junction~
   This lit meeting of passages affords several choices- firstly there is the
way out to the east, then there are two branches to the north and west, the
former of which emanates sounds of excavation, as well as cheery singing.  
Several sacks of tools and ore lie scattered all over the floor, haphazardly
left there by the workers.    
