#40193
A New Excavation~
   The northern wall of this unfinished chamber shows signs of recent work,
deep gouges and rocks torn from their beds, and cast aside.  Piles of rubble
await shifting by orcish slaves, while a wooden rack supports the various tools
used by the hardy stone giants employed by many races, not all evil, for their
excellent mining skills.    
~
