#40196
A Dark Hallway~
   Progress down this empty corridor confirms your earlier suspicions- this
rubble-strewn section of the Steading is indeed deserted.  A thick layer of
dust coats the rubble, evidence of past construction that was abandoned for
some reason, most probably laziness.  There is little evidence of any items of
use, however a set of footprints, elf-sized in fact, heading north indicates
that at least one other person has dared this empty hall.    
~
