#40197
A Dark Hallway~
   The corridor branches here, with a second passage heading northwest, into
the darkness.  To the north, the passage heads towards a set of stairs, barely
visible from here, heading upward a few feet to a raised area, the contents of
which cannot be deciphered.  The tracks in the dust eschew this route, heading
instead to the northwest, the maker of the tracks having apparently not cared
whether progress he or she made was visible to others, elves can move so as to
leave no trace of their passage if they so wish.    
~
