#40198
A Dark Hallway~
   Nearing the stairs, you can hear the sound of dripping water, and a slight,
cool breeze brushes your face.  No other sound can be made out, nor is there
any evidence of other occupants.  Occasionally a soft splash will echo down the
corridor, its source unknown.  Perhaps this was once a source of water for the
giants, abandoned when a more convenient source was found.    
~
