#40199
The Cistern~
   The steps rise to the edge of a circular, giant-made chamber, then head down
the other side into the basin of the well, which is mostly filled with a deep
pool of dark water.  Water flows into the pool through hidden, equally
artificial, inlets, and the overflow from here drains off into a shallow trench
that circles the cistern, which in turn runs off down several small holes.  
The air is cool, and quite pleasant.    
~
